# The web app needs no environment variables; it runs fully local-only.
# (Cloud sync was cut from v1 and archived; see archived/RESTORE.md.)
#
# The mobile app has ONE optional variable, set in `mobile/.env.local` (or as
# an EAS build env var), never committed:
#
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=<your Sentry DSN>
#
# It turns on crash reporting (mobile/platform/crashReporting.ts). Unset, the
# app runs with reporting fully inert: no init, no network, no console noise.
